# Kamailio dispatcher destinations (plan contract 7): set 1 is every
# hello-sip node, by compose service name. Format:
#   setid destination flags priority attributes
# Flags 0: start active; probing (ds_probing_mode 1) then keeps each
# destination's state from its OPTIONS answers. The names resolve through
# the kamailio service's extra_hosts (fixed IPs on the edge network), so a
# stopped node never disappears from the list. Phase 6 replaces this file
# with a dynamic source.
1 sip:hello-sip-1:5060 0 0 duid=hello-sip-1
1 sip:hello-sip-2:5060 0 0 duid=hello-sip-2
